        "Name": {
          "Namespace": "PlayerBackground",
          "Key": "1_Name",
          "SourceString": "幕间小憩",
          "LocalizedString": "Intermission"
        },
        "Quality": 1,
        "Desc": {
          "Namespace": "PlayerBackground",
          "Key": "1_Desc",
          "SourceString": "来自星辰的守护者沉沉睡去。在她的梦中，是否能看到某种预兆？关于未来，关于这个世界……\n“无数次……无数次……”",
          "LocalizedString": "The Guardian from the stars has fallen into a deep slumber. In her dreams, will she glimpse any omens about the future, and this world?\n\"Countless times...\""
        },
        "IconItem": {
